eptember-30-2026/build/paper.tex","line":106,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"55afa1a2653d1cb687b8dca2d6762099f8397da860eb9b46bb90eedd0cf2c4af","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/The-Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis-September-30-2026/build/paper.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:ddc45d2b8033995df61058b8f8a8a64428c22f65ff656fe25c240fa687e306ee","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis-September-30-2026/build/paper.tex#L106"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nEvery finite-order Hecke $L$-function over\n$F=\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-3})$ has no zero in $\\Re s>7/8$.\nThe same holds for every Dirichlet $L$-function, including $\\zeta(s)$.\nA pole at $s=1$ for a principal character is allowed."}
